What the translation contains:[0m[0m
- [38;5;10msrc/lib.rs[0m — the three lookup tables ([38;5;10mM_MANTISSA[0m 2048×u32, [38;5;10mM_OFFSET[0m 64×u16, [38;5;10mM_EXPONENT[0m 64×u32) transcribed mechanically from the C initializers, plus the conversion function. Tables were extracted by script rather than by hand, so no transcription drift.[0m[0m
